<title>FINLAND: TABLE- Stockmann H1 op profit up 62 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Stockmann H1 op profit up 62 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June, 1997-</p>
<p>					  (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit				 145.1 vs 89.5</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax   161.7 vs 110.6</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   7.80 vs 5.52</p>
<p> Turnover					 3,285.0 vs 2,912.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast for Finnish retail group Oy Stockmann Ab's H1 profit before extraordinary items and tax had been 103.0 million markka (range 88-132 million).  </p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation     202.9 vs 140.1</p>
<p> Depreciation					57.8 vs 50.6</p>
<p> Net financial items			gain 16.6 vs 21.1 gain</p>
<p> Taxes						 49.3 vs 31.0</p>
<p> Net profit					 112.4 vs 79.6</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    60.0 vs 66.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish retailer is Oy Stockmann Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 9 680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
